<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<!--
  GENERATED FILE - do not edit by hand.
  Source of truth: tools/generate_worlds.py (edit the layout there, re-run it).

  Open production hall with racking aisles and machine bays - wide free space broken by regular tall obstacles.
